# Animator from C# (CS-5 a): state, Play and normalized time on AnimationTest's Blender.
#   ./.build/Editor_Debug/Havana --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/AnimatorTest.lvl --editor-exec Assets/Scenes/Tests/AnimatorFlows.edscript
wait-log dotnet ready | 7200
wait 30
play
wait-log AnimatorProbe: playing True in Bend | 600
wait-log AnimatorProbe: after Play in Wave at a valid time | 600
stop
quit
